#: ../../source/export.rst:154 b113c68503ee443c9305aabfd085a883
msgid ""
"The search mode is the one parameter that changes memory by an order of "
"magnitude, because the eight-direction sweep (``MODE_HH``) keeps a full "
"``width x height x numDisparities`` cost volume while the others keep a "
"single row. ``minimal`` is the cheapest in memory, not the fastest: "
"``fast`` holds the same memory and runs nearly four times sooner, and it "
"is slightly more accurate too. Choose ``minimal`` when the target cannot "
"afford the 3-way sweep's working set, not for speed."
